  noteTitle: 'Office Memos 1/4 Emergency:'
  noteContent: In case of a sudden power failure or incident requiring evacuation/isolation,
    personnel should proceed to the nearest designated assembly points. Basic emergency
    equipment, including flashlights and first-aid kits, are located in the Porter's
    Office. Emergency charging stations for portable flashlights are available in
    select computer labs and technical rooms...
